/T (The Pune Institute of Computer Technology Model United Nations \(PICT MUN\) provides a stimulating environment for students to develop their leadership skills and global awareness. Participants take on the roles of diplomats representing different countries in meticulously designed United Nations simulations, working together to address urgent real-world issues. )
/E (The Pune Institute of Computer Technology Model United Nations \(PICT MUN\) provides a stimulating environment for students to develop their leadership skills and global awareness. Participants take on the roles of diplomats representing different countries in meticulously designed United Nations simulations, working together to address urgent real-world issues. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
