/P 191 0 R
/T (Students from various academic and cultural backgrounds come together through PICT MUN, which promotes teamwork and creative thinking. In addition to developing deep relationships with peers, this stimulating environment helps participants improve their research skills, public speaking abilities, and understanding of current events. )
