264 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 193 0 R
/T (It is my great honour to welcome you to PICT Model United Nations 2026. Serving as the Director General of this conference is both a privilege and a responsibility, and I am truly humbled to lead an event that over the years has become one of the finest platforms for dialogue, learning and collaboration. PICT MUN has established itself as one of the finest conferences in the circuit, known for its high standards of debate and professionalism. It is not just a platform for discussing policies, but a space for understanding perspectives and discovering the value of cooperation. These qualities are at the heart of what I wish every delegate to take away from PICT MUN 2026.)
/E (It is my great honour to welcome you to PICT Model United Nations 2026. Serving as the Director General of this conference is both a privilege and a responsibility, and I am truly humbled to lead an event that over the years has become one of the finest platforms for dialogue, learning and collaboration. PICT MUN has established itself as one of the finest conferences in the circuit, known for its high standards of debate and professionalism. It is not just a platform for discussing policies, but a space for understanding perspectives and discovering the value of cooperation. These qualities are at the heart of what I wish every delegate to take away from PICT MUN 2026.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
